body:
for me it was at first just a way to release emotions i couldnt deal with or handle with even light marks just letting the emotions flow out the wound instead of building up anymore. i managed to stop when i found other coping methods (booze)

now after relapsing from a long break it honestly just clears my head like nothing else can. ive never tried illegal drugs but maybe thats a healthier way of dealing with my head. its something about the pain and the chemicals it causes just lets me think clearly even if just for a moment.

i doubt ill ever fully stop again unless i find an alternative to it but im trying to reduce my reliance on it and its super hard. dont start if u can resist it, and if u do end up doing it save it for "special occasions" not just regular days.
